    "content" : "approach is to thoroughly review systems, starting at the top with headaches, moving on to upper respiratory and breathing problems, gastrointestinal issues, and sexual partners/urination."
  }, {
    "type" : "text block",
    "id" : 32,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 37.599, 591.714, 332.39, 731.214 ],
    "kids" : [ {
